      "writtenOn": "2020-09-14T15:19:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Potentially.  Not all chargers have the ability to detect Vbus level by port, so we\u0027d probably want to guard on CONFIG_USB_PD_VBUS_DETECT_CHARGER or CONFIG_USB_PD_VBUS_MEASURE_CHARGER.\n\nVbus measure seems like it could work, though some of the boards with it enabled (ex. hatch) are detecting Vbus via the PPC so that could change behavior from those boards.  Vbus detect would apply to a more limited subset of boards, mostly older ones (ex. eve).  \n\nWhat do you think, Aseda?",
      "parentUuid": "95102cf0_7d6b5fcf",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 78,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 88,
        "endChar": 0
      },
      "revId": "e6e15df132f17a0b7de2390b6665dd8a34e0d2f5",
